OL,3,GNEWSAMPs back 'urgent intervention'
OL,4,Aover hospice cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs in Surrey and South West London
OL,7,Fhave called on the prime minister to
OL,8,F"urgently intervene" after a hospice
OL,9,Fwarned that it needs to reduce costs by
OL,10,F#3.5m a year.
OL,12,FPrincess Alice Hospice in Esher said it
OL,13,Fwould need to put 62 jobs at risk,
OL,14,Fciting financial pressures facing
OL,15,Fservices across the country.
OL,17,FA group of Liberal Democrat MPs in the
OL,18,Farea say its constituents will be
OL,19,F"directly impacted by these cuts", and
OL,20,Fhave asked in a letter to meet Andy
OL,21,FBurnham and Health Secretary Yvette
OL,22,FCooper about the cuts.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
