OL,3,GNEWSAMPs back 'urgent intervention'
OL,4,Aover hospice cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Department of
OL,7,FHealth and Social Care (DHSC)
OL,8,Fpreviously said it was committed to
OL,9,Fimproving palliative care.
